        blocked_by   [
                     @task.Rewrite.T001,
                     @task.Rewrite.T002,
                     @task.Rewrite.T004,
                     @task.Rewrite.T005,
                     @task.Rewrite.T006,
                     @task.Rewrite.T007,
                     @task.Rewrite.T008
                     ]
        description
            Historical read-only gate: review only changed Phase 1 slices, their named proof
            evidence, direct provenance, and relevant deletion/retention boundaries. Reuse
            production-owner proofs; do not repeat unchanged phase matrices. Allow only
            unambiguous mechanical fixes within the reviewed slice.

            Source Bead: flow-state-e7p.1.8 (closed). Decisions from flow-state-e7p.1.2
            and flow-state-e7p.1.10 are represented by their owning Tasks, not separate
            work. Broader Plan outcomes remain open where their runtime or host owners are
            still future work; no partial slice claims to satisfy those outcomes.
        acceptance
            The handback records contract references, changed files, focused checks, lint
            result, behavior reviewed, fixes, blocking findings, and remaining advisory
