            or unclassified proof gap remains in the accepted Phase 1 scope; no hidden
            compatibility, duplicate authority, erased types, uncontrolled work, partial
            update, bespoke Effect clone, or implementation-only proof remains.

            Historical final checks and parent review passed for their recorded snapshot.
            This is not a current-checkout verification claim.
